    {
      "id": "reduce-tree",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "```text\n📁 comic_high\n├── 📁 spritesheet-fram16\n│   └── 📁 PixelEng (Quelle)\n├── 📁 spritesheet-fram14\n├── 📁 spritesheet-fram12\n├── 📁 spritesheet-fram10\n└── 📁 spritesheet-fram8\n\n📁 spritesheet-framN\n├── 📁 PixelEng\n│   ├── 📄 <Name>.png\n│   ├── 🎞️ <Name>_8fps.gif\n│   └── 🌐 gif-vergleich.html\n├── 📄 <Name>_<CxR>_o.png\n├── 🎞️ <Name>_<CxR>_o_8fps.gif\n├── 🌐 gif-vergleich.html\n├── 📝 README.md\n├── 📄 build-info.json\n└── 📄 pruefung.json\n```",
      "mdvieweditor": {
        "version": 1,
        "textMode": "markdown"
      },
      "x": 1752,
      "y": 1560,
      "width": 456,
      "height": 624,
      "label": "comic_high"
    },
    {
      "id": "913bd873-c811-43d9-a3f1-01ce4f17239b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Vor PNG/GIF/HTML/Berichten: Ziele prüfen\n--dry-run: nur prüfen\nNormal: belegte Varianten überspringen\n--overwrite: Ausgaben neu erstellen\n--dry-run --overwrite: nur Plan\nOriginale + fremde Dateien behalten.",
      "mdvieweditor": {
        "version": 1,
        "textMode": "plain"
      },
      "x": 1752,
      "y": 2232,
      "width": 456,
      "height": 216,
      "label": "🐍 PyPipelineOutputs.py",
      "color": "#249c98"
    }
